mpt boundary","MV3 service-worker termination and message wake-up","real keyboard focus and 320px reflow","two-stage exact-origin batch permissions with temporary tabs discovery and redundant cleanup","stable browser import operation IDs and non-overwriting version queue","persistent idempotent receipt replay","move-only duplicate resolution preserves content, metadata, and AI permission","complete App Store application product build"],"strictness":"always","command":["bash","script/check_browser_extension_release.sh"]},
